    "设置…" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Settings…" } }} },
    "关于 Folio" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "About Folio" } }} },
    "Windows 版本 %@" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Version %@ for Windows" } }} },
    "打开所在文件夹" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Open Containing Folder" } }} },
    "Windows 安全中心或杀毒软件可能拦截了端口 %@。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Windows Security or an antivirus program may be blocking port %@." } }} },
    "翻译服务的 API 密钥用 Windows 数据保护（DPAPI）加密，只有当前 Windows 用户能读取。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "API keys for translation services are encrypted with Windows Data Protection (DPAPI); only your Windows account can read them." } }} },
    "%@（推荐）" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%@ (recommended)" } }} },
    "%lld 个文件未检索到元数据，已保留为独立文件" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%lld files had no metadata found and were kept as standalone files" } }} },
    "%lld 星" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%lld stars" } }} },
    "%lld 篇文献" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%lld items" } }} },
    "%lld 篇文献会失去这个标签，文献本身不受影响。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%lld items will lose this tag. The items themselves are not affected." } }} },
    "%lld 项" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%lld items" } }} },
    "AI 接入正在移植中" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "AI integration is coming soon" } }} },
    "DOI、arXiv ID 或 ISBN，每行一个" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "DOI, arXiv ID or ISBN, one per line" } }} },
    "Mac 版 Folio 的文献库文件夹可以直接在这里打开（例如放在同步盘中），两边格式相同。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "A library folder of Folio for Mac can be opened here directly (for example in a synced folder): both use the same format." } }} },
    "Zotero 导入正在移植中" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Zotero import is coming soon" } }} },
    "「%@」在回收站中" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "“%@” is in the Trash" } }} },
    "从分组中移除" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Remove from Group" } }} },
    "会删除这个配置保存的地址、模型和 Key。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The address, model and key saved in this configuration will be deleted." } }} },
    "使用所选" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Use Selected" } }} },
    "保存为配置" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Save as Configuration" } }} },
    "允许浏览器插件保存到 Folio" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Allow the browser extension to save to Folio" } }} },
    "先选中要摘录的文字" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Select the text to excerpt first" } }} },
    "写入新标注的作者名，其他 PDF 阅读器会在标注列表中显示。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The author name written into new annotations; other PDF readers show it in their annotation lists." } }} },
    "分组中的文献会保留在文献库中，也可以一并移到回收站。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The items in the group stay in the library, or can be moved to the Trash with it." } }} },
    "分组名称" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Group name" } }} },
    "删除分组并将文献移到回收站" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Delete Group and Move Items to Trash" } }} },
    "删除配置“%@”？" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Delete the configuration “%@”?" } }} },
    "加入笔记" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Add to Note" } }} },
    "可以把这个文件作为附件添加到该条目，或者放弃它。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "You can add this file to the item as an attachment, or discard it." } }} },
    "同一服务和模型再翻译一次时；保留两者时按翻译时间区分，替换的旧译文会移到回收站" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "When a paper is translated again by the same service and model. Kept translations are told apart by their time; replaced ones go to the Trash." } }} },
    "回收站中的文献和文件将被永久删除，无法恢复。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The items and files in the Trash will be deleted permanently. This cannot be undone." } }} },
    "在这台电脑上找不到 %@。请先安装并登录 %@，或在设置中填写它的路径。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%@ was not found on this computer. Install %@ and sign in first, or enter its path in Settings." } }} },
    "在这台电脑上找不到 %@。请先安装并登录，或在 设置 ▸ 翻译 的高级选项里填写它的路径。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%@ was not found on this computer. Install it and sign in first, or enter its path in the advanced options of Settings ▸ Translation." } }} },
    "填写后请求进入 Crossref 与 OpenAlex 的“礼貌队列”，速度更稳定。邮箱只发送给这两个服务。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "With an address, requests go to the “polite pool” of Crossref and OpenAlex, which is more reliable. The address is sent only to these two services." } }} },
    "复制 %@ 引用" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Copy %@ Citation" } }} },
    "复制文内引用" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Copy In-Text Citation" } }} },
