    "暂时连不上检索服务，稍后会自动重试「%@」" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Can’t reach the lookup services right now. Folio will retry “%@” shortly" } }} },
    "DeepSeek Harness 的命令行不能使用桌面版的账号登录。请在 DeepSeek Harness 的模型设置中填写 DeepSeek API Key（或设置环境变量 DEEPSEEK_API_KEY）后再试" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "DeepSeek Harness's command line can't use the account the desktop app is signed in with. Enter a DeepSeek API key in DeepSeek Harness's model settings (or set the DEEPSEEK_API_KEY environment variable), then try again" } }} },
    "打开 Folio" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Open Folio" } }} },
    "Folio 仍在运行" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Folio is still running" } }} },
    "关闭窗口后，Folio 会留在通知区域继续运行。点击图标重新打开，在图标的菜单中选择“退出 Folio”彻底退出。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Closing the window leaves Folio running in the notification area. Click its icon to open it again, or choose Exit Folio from the icon's menu to quit." } }} },
    "codex 连不上它的服务商 %@：回复还没完成连接就断了。这个地址打开的是网站而不是接口，中转服务的地址通常要以 /v1 结尾（例如 %@/v1）。请在 CC Switch 或 codex 的配置里改正后再试" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "codex can't get through to its provider %@: the connection closes before the reply is complete. That address opens a website rather than the API; a relay's address usually ends in /v1 (for example %@/v1). Correct it in CC Switch or in codex's configuration, then try again" } }} },
    "codex 连不上它的服务商：回复还没完成连接就断了。请检查 codex 配置里的服务商地址和网络后再试" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "codex can't get through to its provider: the connection closes before the reply is complete. Check the provider address in codex's configuration and your network, then try again" } }} },
