    "数据由 easyScholar 开放接口免费提供：登录 easyScholar 后，在“开放接口”页面复制 SecretKey。密钥加密保存在本机。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Data is provided free by the easyScholar open API: sign in to easyScholar and copy the SecretKey from its “Open API” page. The key is stored encrypted on this PC." } } } },
    "这段文字的排版无法原样修改" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "this text's layout can't be changed in place" } } } },
